\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Peace, perfect peace, 
\par in this dark world of sin?
\par The blood of Jesus 
\par whispers peace wityhin.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Peace, perfect peace,
\par by thronging duties pressed?
\par To do the will of Jesus,
\par this is rest.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Peace, perfect peace,
\par with sorrows surging round?
\par On Jesus' bosom nought
\par but calm is found.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Peace, perfect peace,
\par with loved ones far away?
\par In Jesus' keeping 
\par we are safe and they.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Peace, perfect peace,
\par our future all unknown?
\par Jesus we know, and He is
\par on the throne.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Peace, perfect peace,
\par death shadowing us and ours?
\par Jesus has vanquished death and
\par all its powers.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. It is enough; earth's struggles
\par soon shall cease,
\par And Jesus call us to
\par heaven's perfect peace.
\par \cf1\ul\b  \f1 
\par 
